# FOSS & Privacy Compliance

## License

- Pure FOSS under **Apache-2.0** (not MIT) — see `LICENSE` and ADR-0005
- No proprietary closed-source SDKs in the production path without an explicit ADR
- Prefer F-Droid-friendly dependencies

## Distribution

- GitHub Releases / Obtainium as primary sideload channel
- F-Droid metadata under `metadata/`

## Privacy & Telemetry

- Opt-in only telemetry — never enabled by default
- No PII in logs without explicit user consent
- See `PRIVACY.md`

## Security

- Secrets never committed (Gitleaks / security-scan)
- Dependency scanning via CodeQL, Security scan, Dependency Review
- Input validation at data boundaries
